 "transcript": {
  "language": "en",
  "language_probability": 0.997,
  "duration_seconds": 112.69,
  "segments": [
   {
    "id": "t1",
    "start": 0.18,
    "end": 3.06,
    "text": "Do you know how righteously angry I am?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 3.06,
    "end": 5.82,
    "text": "We learned today through Dr. Fauci's text messages,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 5.82,
    "end": 7.66,
    "text": "meaning messages he sent to other people"
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 7.66,
    "end": 9.46,
    "text": "that the vaccine and the booster,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 9.46,
    "end": 11.54,
    "text": "I don't even know if you can freaking say that on this app"
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 11.54,
    "end": 13.22,
    "text": "because censorship still exists."
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 13.22,
    "end": 14.78,
    "text": "Look at my neck, I'm so mad."
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 15.74,
    "end": 17.5,
    "text": "We learned that through his text messages"
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 17.5,
    "end": 19.66,
    "text": "that the vaccine and the booster was linked"
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 19.66,
    "end": 23.22,
    "text": "to miscarriages in pregnant women in the first trimester"
   },
   {
    "id": "t11",
    "start": 23.22,
    "end": 25.3,
    "text": "and Dr. Fauci knew it."
   },
   {
    "id": "t12",
    "start": 25.3,
    "end": 29.42,
    "text": "The same man who knew that was telling people this publicly."
   },
   {
    "id": "t13",
    "start": 29.42,
    "end": 35.82,
    "text": "CDC and the ACOG, the American College of Obstetrics and Gynecology, who used to say"
   },
   {
    "id": "t14",
    "start": 35.82,
    "end": 41.66,
    "text": "it is okay for them, for pregnant women to get vaccinated, to change now and say it is"
   },
   {
    "id": "t15",
    "start": 41.66,
    "end": 48.22,
    "text": "recommended for pregnant women get vaccinated. So it's really one of those things that's kind"
   },
   {
    "id": "t16",
    "start": 48.22,
    "end": 53.9,
    "text": "of not a close call. And I think it's pretty clear that pregnant women should get that."
   },
   {
    "id": "t17",
    "start": 53.9,
    "end": 59.02,
    "text": "That was the official public narrative. Pregnant women, you're actually like a public nuisance if"
   },
   {
    "id": "t18",
    "start": 59.02,
    "end": 60.9,
    "text": "if you don't get vaccinated."
   },
   {
    "id": "t19",
    "start": 60.9,
    "end": 62.46,
    "text": "And it wasn't just like a small number."
   },
   {
    "id": "t20",
    "start": 62.46,
    "end": 66.7,
    "text": "No, 81 to 82% of women who got the vaccine"
   },
   {
    "id": "t21",
    "start": 66.7,
    "end": 69.34,
    "text": "in the first trimester experience a miscarriage."
   },
   {
    "id": "t22",
    "start": 69.34,
    "end": 71.06,
    "text": "82%."
   },
   {
    "id": "t23",
    "start": 71.06,
    "end": 73.14,
    "text": "I think of all the harm that was done during COVID,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t24",
    "start": 73.14,
    "end": 74.62,
    "text": "like to kids who couldn't go to school,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t25",
    "start": 74.62,
    "end": 76.54,
    "text": "to elderly who died in nursing homes alone,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t26",
    "start": 76.54,
    "end": 78.22,
    "text": "to weddings that were postponed."
   },
   {
    "id": "t27",
    "start": 78.22,
    "end": 81.14,
    "text": "This makes me the most mad."
   },
   {
    "id": "t28",
    "start": 81.14,
    "end": 84.26,
    "text": "And like, are we gonna see anything done about it?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t29",
    "start": 84.26,
    "end": 86.42,
    "text": "Why should we feel hopeful that we will?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t30",
    "start": 86.42,
    "end": 87.7,
    "text": "Again, with the pardon situation,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t31",
    "start": 87.7,
    "end": 92.46,
    "text": "But even beyond that, like there's a whole lot of talk in Washington DC and not a lot"
   },
   {
    "id": "t32",
    "start": 92.46,
    "end": 93.46,
    "text": "of accountability."
   },
   {
    "id": "t33",
    "start": 93.46,
    "end": 99.38,
    "text": "So not hopeful, but I hope these women and these families who suffered at the hands of"
   },
   {
    "id": "t34",
    "start": 99.38,
    "end": 104.14,
    "text": "Fauci can make their case and I hope they win big, although it will never really be"
   },
   {
    "id": "t35",
    "start": 104.14,
    "end": 107.46,
    "text": "justice because their babies aren't here with them."
   },
   {
    "id": "t36",
    "start": 107.46,
    "end": 108.46,
    "text": "It makes me sick."
   }
  ]
 },
